cus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6206514","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["呼……我不能辜负他们的期待。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,11,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"11":{"step":[[11,12,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["年轻的姑娘揉了揉眼睛，将思绪重新浸入脖颈与帽檐之间的领地。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"12":{"step":[[12,13,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017991#1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["留给《群岛史》的版面大概还有三分之一张报纸……可这座岛上还有太多我没有提及的内容，它们说不定正是读者尚未了解的……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"13":{"step":[[13,14,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017987#1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5|1.5","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["丹尼希女士曾说，连编辑们都对弗兰南群岛的谜团相当好奇……如果内容足够丰富，兴许她会允许我再补充一节！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"14":{"step":[[14,91,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6206505","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这样，人们就能完整地了解弗兰南群岛发生的一切了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"15":{"step":[[15,16,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她打起精神，又伏在了书案上。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“弗兰南群岛，位于苏格兰的外赫布里底群岛之中。关于它的讨论已持续了数年。直到今天，我们仍能记起关于它的传闻……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“据可靠消息称，不论是在灯塔内，抑或是岛上的任何一处角落，一切似乎都无比正常。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“除了那三位离奇消失的灯塔管理员……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“人们纷纷猜测其中的可能性。来自官方的调查员先生坚持认为，某场意外发生的海上风暴吞没了他们……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306519.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“但这显然无法说服大多数人……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306522.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“有水手声称，他在弗兰南群岛的上空目睹了来自太空的飞碟，它们通体黝黑，散发着幽深而寒冷的光束……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“当然，关于巨型鸟类、无底深渊的猜测同样不少……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“人们众说纷纭，但始终没能得出答案……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306519.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“警察先生们出具的调查报告，守塔员们所遗留的日志记录，以及迟迟未能找到的尸体……它们提醒着我，这绝非一起简单的失踪事件……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“尽管已过去了十二年，但怀着对真相的好奇，我仍然决定来到这座岛上……也见到了那份始终没有公开的记录。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,96,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“上面的落款是，1900年12月15日 记录人：杜卡特。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6206508","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["握笔的手顿在了半空，如同无风的帆船，迟迟未能驶入下一行。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这起事件已经过去了这么多年，关于岛上的谜团并没有减少，反而越来越多了……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017980","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我……该如何拣选这些素材呢？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当我尚未踏上这座岛时，我便听说了水手们的传闻。途径这儿的船只大多会无故抛锚，甲板上甚至会渗出古怪的液体……以致于这儿的航线远比其他岛更少。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这是个值得一写的故事……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017991","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可……十二年都不曾中断的灯塔同样是个重大的问题。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果没能将它记入《弗兰南群岛史》，我一定会抱憾终身……！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当然，还有最重要的守塔员失踪事件……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她陷入了迟疑。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["残酷的、不留情面的选择题横亘在这个可怜姑娘的眼前。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6206508","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017972","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["《弗兰南群岛史》属于弗兰南群岛全体对象。出于公平起见，我也应该平等地使用它们……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,41,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["无论放弃哪一个，都是对弗兰南群岛的背弃，是对这本书的误读！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她的目光游离，落在更多、更多的稿纸之上。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,97,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一条足以容纳所有内容的路显现了出来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我放下了那本记录本，注意到身前这个仍然发着光亮的灯塔。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“在那段离奇的失踪案之后，再也没有新的管理员愿意驻扎在弗兰南群岛……艾琳·莫尔灯塔早已无人维护，至少本应如此。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我站在灯塔的底下，逐级向上攀爬。出乎我意料的是，脚下的石阶，严丝合缝的绳结与螺丝，以及从塔顶向四周洒下暖黄色光亮的灯泡……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/chuancangneibu.jpg","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"610017975","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“它们无声无息，却又诚实地向我传达着一个震撼了我许久的讯息：使那座灯塔得以正常运转的一切，都仍保存着十二年前的余光！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我的脚步虚浮，几乎惊讶地向后仰翻……可我要怎么相信呢？”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“那些使我双脚打滑的苔藓与斑驳的划痕，毫不留情地向我证明着，这儿确确实实已经历经了整整十二年的时光。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“在短暂地平复心情后，我决定开始探索这儿。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dengta_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":6,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“在此之前，我鸣响了船上的汽笛，以便途径这儿的船只能够注意到这儿。随后，我拿起了仅剩三支的信号弹……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dengta_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“倘若我真的不幸遭遇了意外，凭借这个，海上警事至少能在一周之内来到这儿，收殓我的遗体，也能够将这本群岛史出版，以向世界证明我的贡献。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"6206514","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“再次踏上岛屿后，我的心情早已没有最初的惬意与闲适，些许恐惧与愁苦掩住了它们。但值得庆幸的是，我的心中仍然怀着为人类进步而努力的勇气……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“以及揭开那片令人陌生的、神秘世界的真相。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/heiping.jpg","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“紧锁的房间无法阻挡我的脚步，我灵活地翻过了橱窗，爬进了这个理应早已无人问津的逼仄空间里。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dengta_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["马库斯沉浸在自己唯一的世界里，在白纸上肆意漫步，在墨色的文字间徜徉。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“厨房的门敞开着，里面空无一物，既无发霉的苹果或柑橘，也缺乏必要的蜘蛛网布景。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306521.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我的大脑不由自主地放松了下来，一个更加显而易见，也更加令人轻松的想法从我的脑海中升起。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306519.png","audio":"610017971","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“这也许是一场失败的恶作剧，并且稍显拙劣。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306519.png","audio":"6206508","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“兴许只是某个心血来潮的善良海员路过了这里，为了全体航船的安全，也为了自身的荣誉，他自发地更换了灯塔的灯源，处理了锈迹斑斑的老旧螺丝……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我如此想着。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["马库斯奋笔疾书，周遭的一切声响似乎都远远地消失了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“出于必要的环节考虑，我决定在离开之前做最后一次无关紧要的确认。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,2,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306523.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“这是一场新悲剧的开始。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“我鬼使神差地敲响了卧室的门……当然，我很快便意识到了自己的愚蠢。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/at_guanzhedemen1.jpg","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“咚咚——！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“而当我正准备用力推开那扇尘封的门时，它毫无征兆地打开了，挟着刺耳的嘎吱声。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_5/1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“突如其来的脱力使我踉跄地跌了进去，摔到了壁炉旁。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_5/1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,3,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“不慎擦在手中的煤灰并没有如预想般的冷硬，它们有着恰到好处的余温，似乎理所当然温暖着房内的所有人。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“两道由透明而逐渐变得清晰的身影映入我的眼帘，同时被映出的还有我强烈的恐惧。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"6206509","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“你们是……幽灵？！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“而这两位幽灵先生的惶恐并不亚于我，‘你能看见我们——？！’他们发出了尖锐的呐喊。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72":{"step":[[72,73,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“当我们面面相觑时，一阵不紧不慢的敲门声响了起来，来自门外——”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"73":{"step":[[73,74,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“咚咚——！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,98,""]],"type":6,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“咚咚咚——！咚咚——！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_5/1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306517.png","audio":"610017977","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……？！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/dengta_ye.jpg","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"